        <headline>Flood Advisory issued September 24 at 4:12PM PDT until September 24 at 4:15PM PDT by NWS San Diego CA</headline>
        <description>The Flood Advisory will expire at 415 PM PDT this afternoon for a
portion of Southwest California, including the following area,
Riverside.

The heavy rain has ended. Flooding is no longer expected to pose a
threat. Please continue to heed remaining road closures.
